1.3 Tasks of UX Designer and UI Designer
========================================
A UX (User Experience) Designer focuses on:
•	User satisfaction 
•	Ease of use 
•	User journey 
•	Functionality and usability

Main Tasks of UX Designer
========================
Task	                        Description
====                          ============
User Research	                Understand users and their needs
User Flow Design	            Plan how users move through the system
Wireframing	                  Create rough screen structures
Prototyping	                  Build interactive mockups
Usability Testing	            Test whether users can use the product easily
Information Architecture	    Organize menus, pages, and navigation
Accessibility Design	        Make software usable for all users
Problem Solving	              Reduce user confusion and frustration


A UI (User Interface) Designer focuses on:
•	Visual appearance 
•	Interactive elements 
•	Layout aesthetics (study or philosophy of beauty and taste, particularly in art and nature)

Main Tasks of UI Designer
========================= 
Task                              Description
====                              ===========
Screen Design	                    Design application screens
Color Selection	                  Choose suitable colors
Typography	                      Select fonts and text styles
Button Design	                    Design buttons and controls
Icon Design	                      Create or select icons
Layout Design	                    Arrange UI components
Responsive Design	                Adapt UI to different screen sizes
Visual Consistency	              Maintain uniform design style






